sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Create a lesson from a prepared video
    accDescr: Consent, idempotent enqueue, GPU runner stages, fenced publication, polling and verified download into the existing lesson player.
    autonumber
    actor U as Learner
    participant A as iOS app
    participant API as API, api.lessons
    participant F as Firestore
    participant R as GPU runner parent
    participant G as Gemini API
    participant C as Adapter child and runtime
    participant S as Supabase
    U->>A: Tap Create lesson on a ready video
    A->>API: GET /api/me
    API-->>A: consents.lessonAi.accepted
    opt First time only
        A->>U: Consent sheet, video is sent to Google for AI analysis
        U->>A: Allow
        A->>API: PUT /api/me/consents/lesson-ai
    end
    A->>API: POST /api/projects/id/lessons with inputRevision and Idempotency-Key
    API->>F: Transaction: consent, ready media, length, no active job, quota, accepting
    API-->>A: 202, Location /api/jobs/jobId
    R->>F: Poll and claim buildLesson, lease and heartbeat every 30 s
    R->>S: Download prepared video
    R->>G: Screen whole clip at 5 fps
    alt Not football or no clear player
        R->>F: fail lesson_rejected, no retry, no GPU time used
    else Moves found
        R->>C: generatingBodies, empty environment
        C->>C: Cuts, SAM 3 tracking with ball, SAM 3D Body, re-run lost segments, analysis.analyze
        C-->>R: work/analysis and result.json engine
        R->>G: Look per move, then Teach, then Verify per move
        R->>R: Deterministic checks, build_app, app_contract
        R->>F: reserve_outputs for every file
        R->>S: Upload bundle under users/uid/projects/pid/lesson/jobId/attempt
        R->>F: publish_lesson: lessons doc, job succeeded, project latestLessonId
    end
    loop Every 15 s while the job is active
        A->>API: GET /api/jobs/jobId
        API-->>A: status, stage, lessonId
    end
    A->>API: GET /api/lessons/lessonId
    A->>API: POST /api/lessons/lessonId/assets
    API-->>A: 5 minute signed URLs with sha256 and byteSize per file
    A->>S: Download every file
    A->>A: Verify hashes, LessonPackage.load, move bundle into cache
    A->>U: Open lesson, labelled AI-generated, Report a problem
